    "detailed_description": "Ninjas have never been... painting! Prepare for a colorful, fast-paced adventure!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPerfect Ninja Painter is a colorful arcade puzzle game that's so much fun, it's hard to stop. Paint the walls through 50 levels and try to get all stars!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe original Ninja Painter game has been played more than 100 million times on Flash, the web and mobiles since 2011, and now it's time to get this great experience in HD.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Explore the 5 locations<br />\r\n- Complete 50 levels<br />\r\n- Have a lot of old-school fun!",
